    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10691" root="خشف" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَشِيفٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَشَفٌ</span>, in two places: ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَشُوفٌ</span> also, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also A <i>sharp,</i> or
<i>penetrating,</i> sword; and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاشِفٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَشُوفٌ</span></b> :
(K:) or, applied to a sword, <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَشِيبٌ</span> [q. v.].
(JK.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And Water <i>that runs in a</i> [<i>watercourse
such as is termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطْحَآء</span>, <i>beneath the pebbles, two
or three days, and then goes away.</i> (TA.)

